    <string name="emergency_rules">How it works:\n• 3 sessions per day, 10 minutes each (30 minutes maximum).\n• Only one session can run at a time, for one blocked app.\n• Leaving the app does not pause the countdown.\n• Restarting the phone does not reset the timer or the session count.\n• Sessions reset at midnight, local time.</string>
